(text "BENCH-ONLY 2-PCB AUDIO CABLING CONTRACT. LINK A MAIN AM455 J1502 TO FRONT J1301: PIN1 DEMOD_AF TO DEMOD_AUDIO, PIN2 IF_RETURN TO AF_GND. LINK B FRONT POST-MUTE J1902 TO MAIN LM386 J1202: PIN1 AMP_INPUT_MUTED TO AUDIO_IN, PIN2 AF_GND TO MAIN GND. EXACTLY FOUR SEPARATE NETS, NO SHARED RETURN BETWEEN LINKS IN THIS CABLE DRAWING, NO BYPASS J1302 TO J1202, NO POWER. ALL FOUR ACTUAL PCB ENDS ARE TWO-PIN THT HEADER CANDIDATES; MATING GENDER, POLARIZATION, SHIELD, EMC, CHASSIS, GROUND LOOP, ESD, CONTACT RATINGS, IF/AF LOAD AND PHYSICAL CABLE UNQUALIFIED. NOT A MANUFACTURABLE CABLE OR PCB. NO FAB / NO TX / NO BATTERIA / NO VEICOLO." (at 128.27 179.07 0) (effects (font (size 1 1))) (uuid "f2702026-1118-4000-8000-000000000022"))
